{"seq":15,"slug":"go-concurrency-patterns","title":"Go 并发模式实战","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/languages/go-concurrency-patterns","rating":{"composite":3.8,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# Go 并发模式实战 简介\n\n并发是 Go 的招牌能力，但写对、写好并发代码需要掌握一套模式与纪律。本 hub 面向日常用 Go 做服务端/BFF 的工程师，从 goroutine 与 channel（goroutine 与调度器、channel 基础、select 与超时）讲起，覆盖同步原语（Mutex/RWMutex、WaitGroup/Once、原子操作与内存模型）、Context 与取消（context 传播、取消与截止时间、errgroup），以及并发模式（worker pool 与扇出扇入、流水线、数据竞争与泄漏）。它补足 `07_go-language`（语言层）之外缺失的「并发实战」一层。贯穿全篇的工程纪律是：通过通信共享内存（channel）、保护共享状态用对的锁、任何共享并发读写必须同步（内存模型）、每个 goroutine 都要有可取消的退出路径——并常开 `-race` 检测竞争、用 ctx 贯穿取消以避免泄漏。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"goroutines-and-channels","title":"Goroutines And Channels","docCount":3,"url":"/h/languages/go-concurrency-patterns/goroutines-and-channels","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"goroutines-and-scheduler","title":"Goroutine 与调度器","url":"/h/languages/go-concurrency-patterns/goroutines-and-channels/goroutines-and-scheduler"},{"seq":2,"slug":"channels-basics","title":"Channel 基础","url":"/h/languages/go-concurrency-patterns/goroutines-and-channels/channels-basics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"select-and-timeouts","title":"Select 与超时","url":"/h/languages/go-concurrency-patterns/goroutines-and-channels/select-and-timeouts"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"synchronization","title":"Synchronization","docCount":3,"url":"/h/languages/go-concurrency-patterns/synchronization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mutex-and-rwmutex","title":"Mutex 与 RWMutex","url":"/h/languages/go-concurrency-patterns/synchronization/mutex-and-rwmutex"},{"seq":2,"slug":"waitgroup-and-once","title":"WaitGroup 与 Once","url":"/h/languages/go-concurrency-patterns/synchronization/waitgroup-and-once"},{"seq":3,"slug":"atomic-and-memory-model","title":"原子操作与内存模型","url":"/h/languages/go-concurrency-pa